Terms of Use
------------

This software is intended for tracking and notification of RuneScape investments.
It must not be used to cheat, automate gameplay, or otherwise violate the rules
of RuneScape 3 or Old School RuneScape (OSRS). Use of this tool in a way that
provides unfair advantage, automates in-game actions, or contravenes Jagex's
terms of service is prohibited.
